        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "层: measure compatible referents",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "层 measures layers or floors. The floor of a building is an ordered level; the unit already names what is being counted.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我住在三层。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ zhù zài sān céng 。",
                "meaning": "I live on the third floor.",
                "audio": "065f3c8cfee110675b58958d0119574ebaddf0ccf0e416c9694e71ed0026bea7"
              },
              {
                "text": "这个蛋糕有两层。",
                "pinyin": "zhè gè dàngāo yǒu liǎng céng 。",
                "meaning": "This cake has two layers.",
                "audio": "77507403b7e01e8bb9fc484aee1530fda4993922c5a263bae38dd71850f6114e"
